#. type: Title =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/programmatic-access.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Programmatic access to GBIF-mediated data"
msgstr "透過程式方式存取由 GBIF 提供的資料"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/programmatic-access.adoc:6
msgid "In this module, you will learn how to programmatically access and download GBIF data using the GBIF API or tools or scripts that use the GBIF API."
msgstr "在本章節中，您將學習如何透過 GBIF API，或使用 GBIF API 的工具及腳本，以程式方式存取並下載 GBIF 資料。"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/programmatic-access.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "總覽"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/programmatic-access.adoc:10
msgid "The https://api.gbif.org/[GBIF API^] was developed to provide a programmatic way to query and publish data on GBIF.org. The API can be used to make advanced queries that are not supported by the website. It can also be used to include the results of GBIF queries in scripts, workflows or analyses, which can then be repeated reliably and automatically. It can even allow GBIF data to be embedded into other websites. It can be accessed using any programming language, from a command-line terminal interface, or in some cases using a web browser."
msgstr "https://api.gbif.org/[GBIF API^] 的開發目的，是為了提供一種透過程式方式查詢及發佈 GBIF.org 資料的途徑。此 API 可用於執行網站本身不支援的高階查詢。 此外，它還能將 GBIF 查詢結果整合至腳本、工作流程或分析中，使相關操作得以可靠且自動地重複執行。甚至可將 GBIF 資料嵌入其他網站中。使用者可透過任何程式設計語言、命令列終端介面，或在某些情況下透過網頁瀏覽器來存取此 API。"

